sequenceDiagram
    actor Luis
    participant SP as StaffPage
    participant SC as StaffController
    participant OS as OrderStore
    participant SS as StaffStore

    Luis->>SP: Open an order
    SP->>SC: getOrder(number)
    SC->>SS: findSession(sessionId)
    SS-->>SC: employee
    SC->>OS: getOrder(number)
    OS-->>SC: order and its lines
    Note right of SS: Names and prices come<br/>from the OrderLine rows<br/>saved at acceptance,<br/>never from today's menu.
    SC-->>SP: order details
    SP-->>Luis: Number, items, quantities, time
